        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Recognize Ollama WorkOS session cookies",
        "body": "## Summary\n- identify `wos-session` as a valid Ollama authorization cookie\n- allows zero-config CodexBar usage for accounts that migrate to the WorkOS AuthKit sign-in flow\n\n## Proof\n\nDeterministic test run on this branch (injected HTTP transport — no network, no credentials):\n\n```text\n$ swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests\n◇ Test \"manual mode accepts workos session cookie header\" started.\n◇ Test \"cookie selector accepts workos session cookie\" started.\n✔ Test \"manual mode accepts workos session cookie header\" passed\n✔ Test \"cookie selector accepts workos session cookie\" passed\n✔ Test run with 20 tests in 1 suite passed.\n```\n\nBoth the manual cookie-header resolver and the cookie importer's session selector now recognize `wos-session` alongside the legacy Ollama and NextAuth session names.\n\n## Testing\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests` (20 passed)\n- `swift build` clean\n",
